      "resolution": "Ember Log maps to event or artifact_ref (narrative); ADR and Directive map to decision_ref with subtype."
    },
    {
      "id": "assay_gate_vs_release_gate",
      "terms": ["Assay gate", "release gate"],
      "resolution": "Both gate_ref; distinguish gate_class assay_evidence vs promotion_control in payload."
